Exactly. Pings, notifications, isolated data points that we're desperately trying to string together to make some kind of, you know, coherent sense out of reality.

00:31.200 --> 00:40.840
You get a text, you read a headline, you check a metric on a dashboard, and it all feels like this massive, chaotic, just relentless sequence of disconnected events.

00:41.240 --> 00:49.980
It's an incredibly discreet, fragmented way of living. I mean, we've really been conditioned to process reality step by step, state by state.

00:50.120 --> 00:50.440
Absolutely.

