It completely ignores the complex, higher dimensional organization, the constant physical negotiation happening within the wave that actually allows it to persist as a single coherent structure as it travels through a chaotic environment.

06:41.020 --> 06:48.480
So we're basically looking at the ingredients of the cake and completely ignoring the baking process that holds them together.

06:48.600 --> 06:50.580
That's a great analogy, actually. Yes.

06:50.680 --> 06:53.980
And this brings up a phrase in the text that absolutely blew my mind.

06:53.980 --> 06:58.300
