13:06.980 --> 13:11.320
It's the force of chaotic relaxation that prevents the system from becoming too rigid.

13:11.320 --> 13:18.040
So, on one side, you have L-plus trying to build a fortress, and on the other, you have L-minus trying to dissolve the walls back into the ocean.

13:18.200 --> 13:18.900
Beautifully said.

13:19.020 --> 13:19.240
Yes.

13:19.560 --> 13:24.260
And the text describes an admissibility field equation that governs this battle.

13:24.740 --> 13:29.120
