In hot TT, if two states of light can be smoothly, continuously deformed into one another while maintaining their admissibility, meaning that they never break their global coherence, they never stop being a whirlpool during the transformation, then they are connected by a mathematical path.

18:27.260 --> 18:27.920
Okay, a path.

